Package: crssoccupant
Title: CRSS 2024 Injury Case-Study Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("CAS", "Research", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "research@example.com")
Description: Reproducible preparation of person- and crash-level injury
    datasets from the United States Crash Report Sampling System for
    decision-tree and related case studies, including a serious-injury dataset
    restricted to information available before collision.
